.Dd August 14, 2026
.Dt FILEES-ONBOARD 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm filees-onboard
.Nd consume a FileES invitation and create the OTP outbox
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl config Ar path
.Cm take
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
reads one JSON invitation request from standard input and atomically
creates or resumes the onboarding operation.
It does not send mail.
.Xr filees-bootstrap-entry 8
calls
.Nm Cm take
and then exactly one
.Xr filees-mail 8
.Cm send .
.Pp
The command is a short-lived tool.
It has no listener and accepts no extra arguments.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr filees-bootstrap-entry 8 ,
.Xr filees-mail 8
